# Uploaded assets are PUBLIC. Finder writes .DS_Store into any directory it is
# asked to display, including build output, and wrangler will happily serve it
# - two of them were live on hc.auxgoat.com until 2026-09-07. A .DS_Store lists
# the names of everything that was ever in its directory, which is not a
# catastrophe and is also not something to publish.
#
# This file lives in web/public/ rather than backend/public/ because vite's
# emptyOutDir wipes the latter on every build.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
